<section class="page-hero editorial-hero"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Company</p><h1>About Axentra</h1><p class="lead">Axentra is an alternative legal and business process services company serving clients in India and international markets.</p><p>We work as an extended specialist team for law firms, in-house functions, lenders, servicers and legal, contract and property technology companies.</p><p>Clients engage Axentra for defined projects, on-demand requirements, managed recurring workflows, dedicated teams and professional secondments.</p><p>Our teams combine subject knowledge, documented processes, technology, human review and quality controls to deliver the agreed work and make useful improvement opportunities visible.</p></div></section>
